window.products.push({"id":1006014,"name":"Essential Oil Diffuser, VICKMALL 300ml Wood Grain Aromatherapy Ultrasonic Cool Mist Whisper-Quiet Humidifier with Color LED Light Changing and 4 Timer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Kr9xCh6bL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"Cool Humidifier Descriptions: Simple Operation: Based on user-friendly principle, this essential oil diffuser is easily to use, no complicated operation. The using steps is presented as blow: 1.Put this product on a horizontal position; 2.Lift up the cap of the humidifier, fill the water tank with purified water; 3.Add drops of aromatherapy /essential oil into the water tank; 4.Connect the humidifier to power source and press \"MIST\" to choose your desired mode. 5.You can press \"LIGHT\" to change the color of LED light. 6. When the water is used up, the unit will automatically power off along with \"beep\" sound. Specifications: Water Capacity: About 300ml Working time: 10 hours Timer: 1 H/ 3 H/ 6 H/ ON Noise Level: less than 25 dB Dimensions: 168.5*93.5 mm Weight: 410g Length of power line: 170cm Material: Upper parts PP, ABS, PC Input power: AC 100-240V 50/60HZ/DC 24V 650MA Ultrasonic Frequency: 2.4 MHz - Advanced Ultrasonic Diffusing Technology Function Keys: \"MIST\": Press the \"Mist\" button, choose the time from 1 hour/3 hours/6 hours/steady on. \"Light\": Press the \"Light\" button to turn on the LED light, the color will change automatically. 7 colors avaliable.  Each color is adjustable between Bright and Dim. Package Contents: 1 x Oil Diffuser 1 x Adapter 1 x Manual Warranty: 45 days money-back & 12-months warranty & Within 24 hours response ! NOTE: Do not add water over MAX line(less water, more mist) . Oil is not included in the package. Press the mist button for 2 seconds to switch between the strong and weak mist. Do not press the \"MIST\" button when the tank is empty.If there is no water but press the \"MIST\"button, the diffuser will be burned out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Kr9xCh6bL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VICKMALL","source_asin":"B01H1OWVNG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1006014","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01H1OWVNG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01H1OWVNG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
