window.products.push({"id":1006038,"name":"Fissler Protect Alux Premium 11.0 Inch Frypan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31zb0dHB7bL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","description":"The Ultimate Frying System is based on the 2-pan philosophy-Crispy & Protect. A Crispy stainless steel pan is perfect for fast low-fat frying at high temperatures, while a Protect non-stick pan is ideal for easy, gentle cooking. No kitchen is complete without the two. Crispy 18/10 stainless steel frypans feature the internationally-patented NOVOGRILL bottom, a unique honeycomb texture perfect for non-stick grilling and frying without the use of any oils. A healthy way to grill indoors. Protectal Plus is the Stiftung Warentest winner among other European nonstick coatings. Tested for chip-resistance, durability, longevity, evenness, heat distribution, safety, ease of cleaning, and quality of coating after abrasion tests. Chip-resistant Protectal Plus is the strongest and safest non-stick application on the market. This test-winning sealing and process involves the application of multi-layers of fine ceramic and titanium under pressure in Fissler's patented process. Protectal Plus is Fissler's own internationally patented coating which is perfectly safe and durable. The ergonomic safety handle lies perfectly in your hand and the innovative shape of the heat shield offers effective protection because it stops fingers from slipping. The CookStar all-stove base, which is comprised of a pure aluminum core and high-quality 18/10 stainless steel, ensures that the base that will never separate or warp. The energy-saving base also provides quick optimal heat distribution, diffusion, and storage without any hot spots. Safe for induction stoves. The attractive mirrored hanging eyelet allows for space-saving solutions in the kitchen. The pouring rims on all the pans allow for precise and dripless pouring. Some pans even come equipped with a practical measuring scale on the inside. Limited lifetime warranty. Made in Germany.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31zb0dHB7bL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fissler","source_asin":"B000GQ8S9I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1006038","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000GQ8S9I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000GQ8S9I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
