window.products.push({"id":1006061,"name":"Howard Miller Avalon Floor Clock 611-220 – Espresso Grandfather Timepiece Home Decor with Illuminated Case & Quartz, Triple-Chime Movement","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gZWV8siQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FLOOR CLOCK: The Avalon Floor Clock has an Espresso finish on select hardwoods and veneers to be ideal vertical decor in the home. The design includes a modern, flat top with a platform base, and beveled glass on the front of the illuminated case. DURABLE: This gorgeous floor clock has a sturdy wood frame with adjustable levelers to provide stability and relieve stress in a busy household. The gloss white dial contains black hour markers, minute track and hands, and polished chrome-finished bezel, while the polished chrome-finished pendulum and decorative weight shells add a beautiful touch. CHIMES: The quartz, triple-chime movement plays a choice of full Westminster, or Ave Maria chimes with strike on the hour and ¼, ½, and ¾ chimes accordingly. Switch between the Westminster chime and strike on the hour only or the Bim Bam chime only on the hour. Set the automatic nighttime chime shut-off for volume control to have in any room. DIMENSIONS: The height of this clock is 76 inches (193 cm), with a width of 16 inches (41 cm) and a depth of 10.75 inches (27 cm). Powered and operated by a quartz, triple-chime movement and requires four C sized batteries (not included). Made in the USA. HOWARD MILLER: Founded in 1926 and still family-owned in its third generation, Howard Miller is the world’s leading clock company and a respected brand name in fine specialty furnishings such as curio cabinets, wine and bar furnishings, custom storage cabinets, and SmartMoves adjustable height desks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gZWV8siQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B00J4VY0FM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1006061","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00J4VY0FM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00J4VY0FM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
