window.products.push({"id":1006082,"name":"Sushi Making Kit - All in One Set with Bazooka, Sushi Knife, Natural Bamboo Mats, Paddle, Spreader, Chopsticks, Holders, Bag, Saucers - Make Your Own ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917JmEP9PpS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With the Lionly Sushi Making Kit, you have all the tools to easily prepare your favorite sushi recipes in no time! THE EASIEST WAY TO MAKE THE PERFECT SUSHI No more spending money on expensive restaurants, instead gather with family and friends, host a party, or simply refine your skills and enjoy the perfect home sushi roll every time. HIGH QUALITY DURABLE PRODUCTS Premium Grade Sushi Knife The redesigned Lionly sushi knife measuring 30x4cm features an extra sharp stainless steel perforated blade to help you cut your sushi rolls with ease.Manufactured using high quality materials, our premium knife is durable and sturdy to last longer and the ergonomic design offers a more comfortable hand grip. Natural and Safe Material Our bamboo products are made with top quality natural bamboo material. Every item in our Sushi Making kit is made of 100% food grade material and our Bazooka is BPA Free. This ensures it is safe to use with your family. PRINTED INSTRUCTIONS & DOWNLOADABLE SUSHI RECIPE BOOK If this is your first time attempting to make sushi, don’t worry! We have you covered. Included in each Sushi Making Kit is a step-by-step instruction guide on how to use your Lionly Sushi Making Kit and Bazooka to create amazing mouth watering sushi every time like a pro. THE PERFECT GIFT The Lionly Sushi Making Kit isn’t just a sushi kit, it is also an amazing home experience to be shared with family and friends. Throw a party, make it a sushi night and become your very own sushi chef.Makes the perfect gift for your kids, mother, friends or family. Create beautiful, fresh, tasty sushi recipes in no time that are sure to bring tons of smiles and joy! OUR GUARANTEE Our worry free guarantee offers 100% satisfaction or your money-back. Just scroll up, click add to cart to see for yourself!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917JmEP9PpS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lionly","source_asin":"B08PC9SFQM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1006082","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PC9SFQM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PC9SFQM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
