window.products.push({"id":1006147,"name":"GeekDigg 3 Tier Hanging Shower Caddy, Shower Caddy Basket over Shower Head with Suction Cups, Hooks, Bathroom Caddies, Rustproof Stainless Steel, Silv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C4+AwMesL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Strong Suction Power] The GeekDigg grip shower caddies comes with 3 heavy-duty suction cups to prevent the caddy from swinging, an added over the shower head holder lock on showerhead to help prevent slippage, it will stay on your shower wall sturdy. [Stainless Steel Material] The shower caddy made of steel with a premium finish which is designed to last for years, it’s rust-resistant and ultra-durable. Made for use in moisture-rich bathroom environments; Easy Care - Wipe clean with a damp cloth. Never buy another shower caddy again! [Perfect Size] The three-tier shower caddy is large and versatile enough to fit a variety of items. Upgraded two deep and large baskets are the perfect sizes for multiple bottles, high guard rail keep your stuff from falling, and two hooks are ideal for hanging sponges or towel. A bonus soap holder is oval and vertical wires design which grip the soap easily! The perfect addition to any bathroom. The fit is designed to fit most standard-sized showerheads for a seamless look in the shower. [Easy Installation] Simply hang over the showerhead, and it is ready to use; Designed to work with extra-large, rain-style showerheads, just hang over the neck of your showerhead and use the suction cups to steady it against the wall; Clean and dry the surface area before pressing the suction cups firmly to the surface; Perfect for home, apartments, condos, college dorm rooms. [Thoughtfully Size and Worry-free Service] Measures 24.3'' x 11.6'' x 4.7''; If you are unsatisfied with your product, even past the standard return windows, please feel free to contact us and we will be happy to provide you with your choice of a replacement or refund. We stand by our products 100% and want our customers to love them as much as we do!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C4+AwMesL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GeekDigg","source_asin":"B08B3JPSJZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1006147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B3JPSJZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B3JPSJZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
