window.products.push({"id":1006389,"name":"Seally Cap Reusable Silicone Food Saver, Set of 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cVQ2RzovL._AC_SL1021_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Seally Cap is a versatile kitchen utensil that allows you to reseal items such as canned goods, glasses, canned beverages, fruits, veggies & more. Our unique, yet simple, design allows the Seally Cap to stretch up to twice its size and adapt to different shapes. So if you have half of an apple or an opened can of dog food use the Seally Cap to reseal it. From the Manufacturer ONE SEALLY CAP FITS MULTIPLE SHAPES AND SIZES With our design and special composition of silicone, the Seally Cap can stretch up to twice its size and adapt to different shapes. The possibilities are endless - canned goods, glasses, canned beverages, fruits, veggies & more. REUSABLE!! Cut down on throwing out plastic wrap, plastic bags and aluminum foil. Since the Seally Cap is made out of 100% FDA grade silicone it can be reused over and over again. DISHWASHER, MICROWAVE & FREEZER SAFE Since the Seally Cap is made from 100% FDA grade silicone, it can be easily cleaned in the dishwasher. Need to warm up food? No worries, throw a Seally Cap on the bowl and lock in the moisture. GREAT FOR CANNED GOODS Have pets that eat canned food? Stop using aluminum foil to cover that half can of dog food. Use the Seally Cap, it will keep your fridge from smelling dog food. The Seally Cap keeps in the good and keeps out the bad. SAFE FOR YOU AND YOUR FOOD The Seally Cap is made from 100% FDA grade silicone. It is also BPA and phthalate free. LONG LASTING FOOD FOR ALL It is our mission to supply everyone with a reusable, easy to use, simple product that will allow your food to last longer and taste better. All while saving you money in the long run. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Simple, Versatile, Reusable How did you come up with the idea for this product? It actual came out of necessity. I was wasting a lot of beverages by leaving half of a can for later. I decided that I would design something that could do an airtight seal and would be able to use on all sizes of cans. After the list of uses continued to grow I knew I had something worth taking to market. What makes your product special? In one word...versatility. The Seally Cap can do so much with one size that it makes it a must have for all kitchens. What has been the best part of your startup experience? Seeing a dream and idea come to life. It has been nothing short of awesome.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cVQ2RzovL._AC_SL1021_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seally Cap","source_asin":"B012DZK4PK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1006389","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B012DZK4PK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B012DZK4PK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
