window.products.push({"id":1006611,"name":"Tribesigns 5-Tier Bookshelf, 71\" H Gold Book Shelf Large Bookcases and Bookshelves with Chic Circular Design, Tall Open Display Shelf Storage Rack for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x9a3O1D4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Innovative Design, Eye-Catching Style]: This gold bookshelf is an elegant and stylish piece of furniture that will add sophistication to any living space. With its unique circles design, this bookcase not only offer a visually stunning design, but also provide a functional way to store and display your favorite items that will catch the eye of any visitor [Plenty of Storage Space]: Measuring 39.4”W x 11.8”D x 70.8”H, this bookshelf offers versatile storage space, making it the perfect solution for organizing all your favorite items. With five spacious shelves, you can store anything from books, decorative items, plants, and more. The open design of the shelves provides easy access to your items, while the three different sized circle shapes create an interesting and distinctive display [Multi-Functional Use]: The versatility of this tall bookshelf makes it perfect for a wide range of uses. It can be used as a bookcase, display shelf, plant stand or even as a room divider. This gold shelving unit is perfect for any room, whether it be the living room, bedroom, home office, or any other space that needs a little extra storage [High-Quality Materials]: Crafted from high-quality board and a sturdy metal frame, this book shelves built to last for years. Each shelf can hold up to 70lbs, making it perfect for displaying heavy books and decorative items. The white finish is scratch-resistant and easy to clean, and the adjustable foot pads keep the bookshelf level on uneven floors. For added safety, a tip-over restraint device is included [Easy Assembly&Hassle-Free Warranty]: All the necessary hardware and tools are included. The step-by-step instructions make it a breeze to put together, and the process can be completed in no time. Plus, we offer a 18-month warranty and our customer service team is also available to assist you with any questions or concerns","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x9a3O1D4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tribesigns","source_asin":"B0BW5M2NML","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1006611","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW5M2NML","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW5M2NML","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1006612,"name":"greenoak Electric Blanket Heated Blanket Full 80\"x84\",10 Heating Level Flannel Fast Lap Heating Blanket with Dual Control,5 Timer Auto Off Soft Electr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GM3LhTghL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DUAL-CONTROL DESIGN & MEET DEMAND: Each controller can adjust the corresponding area of the heated blanket to meet the different temperature needs of two people. Each controller for this electric blanket full size offers offers 10 different heating levels, can be heated from 86℉to 131℉, as well as 5 timer functions for different heating durations. INTELLIGENT OVERTEATING PROTECTION: The heating blanket has the recognized ETL authority certification and overheating protection. It is easy to use in the correct order of use. when the temperature of the controller or the flannel fuzzy electric blanket body is too high, the overheating protection will be automatically triggered to protect you and your family security. DOUBLE-SIDED FLANNEL DESIGNED FOR COMFORT: The warm and fuzzy electric blanket itself consists of four layers, a super soft top flannel layer, a layer of heating wire, an insulating layer for optimal insulation, and a flannel bottom layer, soft and flexible Cords and ultra-soft ultra-light plush fabric ensure your comfort. SUPERIOR HEATING TECHNOLOGY: This 80\"x84\" heated blanket full has built-in heating wires and is placed in a U-shaped pattern to distribute the heat evenly, ensuring that every place you stretch is warm. Rapid heating technology provides you with a warm place in time on cold days. The heating blanket not only save money but are also environmentally friendly. MACHINE WASHABLE & EASY CARE: Just unplug the electric heat blanket controller and toss it into the washing machine, easy and convenient. Line dry or tumble dry on low heat. DO NOT use if wet. Note: TURN OFF and unplug while it is not in use. The Auto-off is not intended to replace the manual turning OFF this flannel heated blanket.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GM3LhTghL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"greenoak","source_asin":"B0B58CG7FH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1006612","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B58CG7FH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B58CG7FH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
