window.products.push({"id":1006662,"name":"Alpine Stainless Steel Soap Dispenser - Commercial Soap Dispenser Wall Mount for Bathroom 1200 ml (Horizontal)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DJQVHWV2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DURABLE CONSTRUCTION. Made using durable, stainless steel construction, this soap dispenser is built to supply long-lasting strength and use year after year. This material is also corrosion- and vandal-resistant, allowing it to be used in all types of environments without the material rusting or eroding away. SIMPLE UTILIZATION. This product works with most free-flowing, all-purpose hand soaps and features a push button with a valve for simple dispensing of the soap. It's also equipped with a clear window on the dispenser's front, so you can easily monitor the level of soap and refill when needed. ADA COMPLIANT. Compliant in force and one-handed operation, this dispenser conforms to the Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA) Standards. These standards state that places of public accommodation must be accessible to people with disabilities. CONVENIENT PRODUCT. The Alpine can be easily installed and mounted on any wall and is furnished in a brushed metal finish that will easily fit into and and enhance any interior setting. It's available in a vertical or horizontal orientation, allowing you to best accommodate your wall space or desired preference. VERSATILE USE. Perfect for use in restrooms, kitchens and lunchrooms, this 40-oz dispenser is ideal for both commercial and public entities, including offices, restaurants, healthcare facilities, schools, hospitals and much more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DJQVHWV2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alpine Industries","source_asin":"B09W7TH8K7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1006662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W7TH8K7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W7TH8K7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1006663,"name":"Totally Bamboo Newboo Salt Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PpKw1OV7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Totally bamboo's newboo salt box is unique, beautiful and practical. this durable, long lasting salt box is constructed of newboo, a lovely, distinctive and ecologically responsible material. newboo is made entirely from rapidly renewable bamboo, this newly developed material is completely\"tree free\", yet it invokes the warmth and beauty of an exotic tropical hard wood. all the sophisticated aesthetics yet none of the guilt. originally developed for use as railroad ties in china, from this humble beginning totally bamboo recognized its potential and has refined the manufacturing process to its current form. utilizing a specially developed system of heating pulverized bamboo fiber, it is then extremely compressed, permanently fusing it together utilizing a food safe, formaldehyde free adhesive to form a void-free block from which totally bamboo's newboo products are made. salt box has a 3.65-inch diameter and is 3-inch tall. 6-ounce capacity.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PpKw1OV7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Totally Bamboo","source_asin":"B0058D0DUG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1006663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0058D0DUG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0058D0DUG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
