window.products.push({"id":1006733,"name":"FAHUA 4 Piece Stretch Couch Cover for 3 Cushion Couch Thick Premium Sofa Slipcover with Individual Cushion Covers Customized 3 Seater Sofa Cover Dog P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I1a-M-DeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"INNOVATED DESIGHN: Our new version 4 pieces stretch couch cover includes 1 base couch cover and 2 individual couch cushion covers, especially suitable for those sofas with separate seat cushions. This fitted sofa cover for 3 cushion couch is designed to fit snuggly to all the contours of your furniture and offers all of removable cover with the added bonus of a custom-tailored look. Plus, elastic bands in the bottom edges fully covers your couch and keep it in place firmly. MEASUREMENTS: We offer 2 sizes of furniture cover. Our large size is suitable for sofa length between 71\"-92\", medium size is suitable for sofa length 56\"-70\". Each seat cushion cover measures up to 20-25 inches length, 20-27.5 inches wide, 2-9 inches thickness. Please measure your sofa from arm to arm before ordering. Installation and measuring guide of furniture protector is displayed in the product pictures. THICKENED MATERIAL: Unlike any other ordinary sofa covers, FAHUA couch slipcover offers a combination of top thickened materials and exquisite workmanship, so these magic sofa covers for living room are designed specifically for extra durability for long-term usage, not easy to be ripped while soft to touch, skin-friendly, breathable and comfortable. It enhances the décor of your home while maintaining quality standards. FULL PROTECT & FRESH NEW LOOK: This thick sofa slipcover is an ideal cover for pet owners as it’s hard to scratch through. Even pet hair will not stick on it and can be easily removed. Not only protects your sofa from accidents, spills, daily stains, but also offers excellent resistance to wear and tear. Various vivid colors are also available for you. Our couch cover for dogs will transforms your old sofa into a brand new one and rejuvenates your home decor right away. EASY MAINTENANCE: Our sofa slip cover is easy to care. Hand wash or machine wash in cold water. Tumble dry and do not bleach. Due to the diverse light and monitor display, colors may slightly differ from picture and product. 100% satisfaction is our promise to you. If you are not happy with our couch cover, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I1a-M-DeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FAHUA","source_asin":"B086HGVS9M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1006733","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086HGVS9M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086HGVS9M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
