window.products.push({"id":1006816,"name":"AEPOALUA Hall Tree with Bench and Shoe Storage, 3-in-1 Coat Rack Shoe Bench, Freestanding Wooden Coat Rack with Shoe Bench with Metal Frame, 3-Tier St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r43FK9QTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STABLE STRUCTURE & SIZE - The size hall tree is 33” L x 12” W x 72” H (84 x 30 x 180 cm), and features remarkable durability and high load capacity. This hallway hall tree is made of a high-quality sturdy steel frame and MDF wood, and it is more durable and strong. Moreover, the hall tree is equipped with 2 anti-tip kits to increase overall stability and prevent tipping over or wobbling! 3-in-1 DESIGN & STORAGE ORGANIZER - This multifunctional entryway hall tree combines 3 functions in 1 unit, which includes an entryway bench, shoe storage, and a coat rack with 9 removable hooks. The entryway bench can hold up to 200 pounds, and you can sit on it and change your shoes. which helps to make your clothes, bags, shoes, keys, storage boxes, hats, scarves, and umbrellas well arranged. Entryway Coat will store many things in limited space, keep your home clean and save you space! 9 REMOVABLE HOOKS - The hall tree with bench and shoe storage includes 9 hooks in 2 rows. All the hooks on our hall tree are movable for your convenience, and you could adjust them to any position you like for organizing various clothes, hats, bags, keys, etc. Each hook is capable of holding 1kg/2lb! WIDE APPLICATION - The perfect combination of white framework and rustic brown wood grain finish gives the clothing rack an elegant and classic look, which fits well with any home decoration style. This coat rack with storage shelves works perfectly in the entryway, hall, foyer, hallway, living room, bedroom, mudroom, or closet room! EASY to ASSEMBLE - This freestanding coat rack shoe bench is simply constructed. Detailed instructions and all numbered accessories and tools required are included for a worry-free assembly. With the help of these tools, you can install the hall tree easily and quickly!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r43FK9QTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AEPOALUA","source_asin":"B0BZCNB6JP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1006816","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZCNB6JP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZCNB6JP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
