window.products.push({"id":1006934,"name":"Taste Your Life 58mm Coffee Distributor & Hand Tamper, Dual Head Coffee Leveler Fits for 58mm Breville Barista Rancilio Portafilter, Double Sided Adju","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51H+TDKVYSL._AC_SL1194_.jpg","description":"Fits All 58mm Portafilters - Be made of Food-Grade 304 Stainless Steel, this 58mm Coffee distributor and hand tamper designed to work with most portafilters and espresso machine models including: Breville, Barista Express, La Marzocco, Rancilio, Rocket, La Pavoni, Alex Duetto, Astoria, ECM and all E61 group machines. Please be careful, for a 58 or 58.5 mm portafilter, you need to choose 58 mm coffee distributor. Adjustable Depth - This espresso distributor increased Depth adjustability to suit any depth of portafilter basket for consistent tamping pressure, makes you enjoy same great consistent cup every time. Depth is adjustable by it's screw mechanism to suit different doses or baskets. And once set, there is no need to change the Depth. Three-page Propeller Design - The 58 mm espresso distributor/leveler is in a 2-in-1 dual head design. It combines the dispenser/leveler and hand tamper functions into one unit. The three-page auger design tampers the coffee powder plane of the bottomless portafilter basket, ensuring consistent tamping pressure and a consistent, even plane every time. Diamond Anti-slip Handle Design - Anti-slip handle is perfect for hand use, super comfortable feel in your hand. Anti-rust design, it’s pretty delicate with premium material and exquisite appearance. Advice from a Professional Barista - Before use, ensure your portafilter basket is fully dosed with coffee grinds to get the right amount of pressure from the tamper for a tighter pack and richer flavor. For best results, groom the top of the basket with a finger or flat edge before leveling and tamping, and finally brew with high quality filtered water to get a fragrant espresso. If you have any questions about this coffee distributor/tamper, please be sure to contact us, we will reply and solve the problem with in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51H+TDKVYSL._AC_SL1194_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TASTE YOUR LIFE","source_asin":"B09Y69YLWP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1006934","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y69YLWP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y69YLWP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
