window.products.push({"id":1006993,"name":"Le Creuset Enameled Cast-Iron 7-1/4-Quart Round French Oven, Cherry Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":398.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71++5eg-ZBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description フランス生まれ、200年の伝統に培われた高品質、世界50カ国以上のシェフに選ばれた優れた機能性。世代を超えて愛される世界中で愛されている鋳物ホーローウェアの逸品。熱伝導に優れた鋳物ホーローは、ムラのない熱まわりで煮物や揚げ物など、微妙な火加減を要する調理もおいしく仕上げ、料理の旨みや栄養分を逃さない。弱火で調理が可能なので、保温性に優れ、経済的。保温性に優れているので、料理が冷めにくく、温かいまま食卓へレモンやワインの酸味にも強く、匂いが染み付かないサイズの長い食材を調理するのにも便利な楕円形の両手鍋気泡に関しては、製造過程の個体差としてどうしても生じてしまうことがありますので、ご了承ください。 Amazon.com Beautiful enough to bring to the table, yet durable enough to outlive its 101-year warranty against defects, this heavy French oven is perfect for preparing and serving ceremonious dishes such as braised short ribs with sauerkraut, cassoulet, and vegetable soup. Use it in the oven or on the stovetop. Made of cast-iron, which is unexcelled for its heat distribution and retention, this French oven cooks foods evenly and gently without hot spots at low temperatures and is suitable for all heat sources. This pan holds 7-1/4 quarts, measures 11 inches in diameter, and its exterior and interior are clad in two coats of Le Creuset's famous bright enamel. The plastic knob on its heavy, tight-fitting lid is ovenproof to 450 degrees F. Loop handles facilitate carrying, and the oven is dishwasher-safe. Like all Le Creuset cast-iron products, it is hand-cast in a one-of-a-kind sand mold and hand-finished at the Le Creuset factory in France. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71++5eg-ZBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B00004SBHA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1006993","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004SBHA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004SBHA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
